      "message": "Looking up TPB3.220513.017.B1 I find myself at https://android-build.googleplex.com/builds/branch-dashboard/git_tm-beta3-release?build_id\u003d8698098\n\npicking raven I reach\nhttps://android-build.googleplex.com/builds/submitted/8698098/raven-user/latest\n\nand the manifest.xml says\n\n\u003cproject path\u003d\"system/bpf\" name\u003d\"platform/system/bpf\" groups\u003d\"pdk\" revision\u003d\"52560978fc146b54f4d4a9db45f2c7cae6b19c73\" upstream\u003d\"tm-beta3-release\"/\u003e\n\nhttps://googleplex-android.googlesource.com/platform/system/bpf/+/52560978fc146b54f4d4a9db45f2c7cae6b19c73/libbpf_android/Loader.cpp\n\nis at BpfLoader v0.13\n\n\u003cproject path\u003d\"system/netd\" name\u003d\"platform/system/netd\" groups\u003d\"pdk\" revision\u003d\"9b2f1f67b1bcbfe56989e06855bb401b39c10672\" upstream\u003d\"tm-beta3-release\"/\u003e\n\nhttps://googleplex-android.googlesource.com/platform/system/netd/+/9b2f1f67b1bcbfe56989e06855bb401b39c10672/include/mainline/XtBpfProgLocations.h\n\ndoesn\u0027t exist, so we should still be pulling from p/m/C\n\n\u003cproject path\u003d\"packages/modules/Connectivity\" name\u003d\"platform/packages/modules/Connectivity\" groups\u003d\"pdk-cw-fs,pdk-fs\" revision\u003d\"6f4b059dd45a97bc661ad223e047102e0090ca8b\" upstream\u003d\"tm-beta3-release\"/\u003e\n\nhttps://googleplex-android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/Connectivity/+/6f4b059dd45a97bc661ad223e047102e0090ca8b/bpf_progs/bpf_shared.h\n\n#define BPF_PATH \"/sys/fs/bpf/net_shared/\"\n...\n#define XT_BPF_INGRESS_PROG_PATH BPF_PATH \"prog_netd_skfilter_ingress_xtbpf\"\n#define XT_BPF_EGRESS_PROG_PATH BPF_PATH \"prog_netd_skfilter_egress_xtbpf\"\n#define XT_BPF_ALLOWLIST_PROG_PATH BPF_PATH \"prog_netd_skfilter_allowlist_xtbpf\"\n#define XT_BPF_DENYLIST_PROG_PATH BPF_PATH \"prog_netd_skfilter_denylist_xtbpf\"\n\nso we see that beta 3.1 (and presumably beta 3.0 since it\u0027s older) already have the old path (net_shared instead of netd_shared) built into p